{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hollow Stories: Lockdown</i> is a survival horror\u00a0<i>noir</i> game set in the 1990s, where every corner hides secrets and nothing is what it seems. Players must uncover a web of police corruption and a hidden cult operating from the shadows, facing moral dilemmas, crime, and violence in a city under siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by late-90s horror and suspense classics, the game blends cinematic fixed cameras with first-person aiming, delivering a neo-retro experience that mixes exploration, tension, and strategic combat. The classic inventory system increases tension by limiting resources, forcing players to make careful, high-stakes decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hybrid Gameplay Cameras</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968040/extras/835b10b4cbc1b5a572ba27a8888fd0a5.poster.avif?t=1758054653\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968040/extras/835b10b4cbc1b5a572ba27a8888fd0a5.webm?t=1758054653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968040/extras/835b10b4cbc1b5a572ba27a8888fd0a5.mp4?t=1758054653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic fixed cameras with first-person transition during shooting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968040/extras/59f158077f222205f26f2df17674c17b.poster.avif?t=1758054653\" width=780 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968040/extras/59f158077f222205f26f2df17674c17b.webm?t=1758054653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968040/extras/59f158077f222205f26f2df17674c17b.mp4?t=1758054653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a gloomy police station, solve puzzles to open your path, and uncover the truth.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern-retro visual style, resembling old PS1 graphics but with high fidelity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1990s-inspired <i>noir</i> aesthetic with a dark, cinematic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story focused on police crimes, conspiracies, and secret cults.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic inventory system that enhances tension through limited resource management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-styled soundtrack that heightens suspense and atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968040?t=1758054653","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968040?t=1758054653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968040/f1549483ccd4b566ca37b56b58381300e7c9d974/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758054653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968040/f1549483ccd4b566ca37b56b58381300e7c9d974/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758054653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game presents a noir-style story set in the 1990s, centered around crime and corruption. It includes moderate graphic violence, combat against armed enemies, and scenes referencing murders and sacrifices carried out by a secret cult within the police. It does not contain depictions of sex, sexual assault, drug use, or self-harm."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hollow Stories: Lockdown</i> is a survival horror\u00a0<i>noir</i> game set in the 1990s, where every corner hides secrets and nothing is what it seems. Players must uncover a web of police corruption and a hidden cult operating from the shadows, facing moral dilemmas, crime, and violence in a city under siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by late-90s horror and suspense classics, the game blends cinematic fixed cameras with first-person aiming, delivering a neo-retro experience that mixes exploration, tension, and strategic combat. The classic inventory system increases tension by limiting resources, forcing players to make careful, high-stakes decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hybrid Gameplay Cameras</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968040/extras/835b10b4cbc1b5a572ba27a8888fd0a5.poster.avif?t=1758054653\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968040/extras/835b10b4cbc1b5a572ba27a8888fd0a5.webm?t=1758054653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968040/extras/835b10b4cbc1b5a572ba27a8888fd0a5.mp4?t=1758054653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic fixed cameras with first-person transition during shooting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa